{
  "key": 8620,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone seems to call me the Berry\n",
        "Master.\r",
        "I hand out Berries daily because\n",
        "I want people to learn how wonderful\\fthey are.\r",
        "You’re deserving of one!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Berries are gifts of nature.\r",
        "I encourage you to feed Berries to\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "That will make Pokémon happy.\r",
        "Seeing that, people will be motivated\n",
        "to plant more Berries.\r",
        "And that will make Sinnoh a greener,\n",
        "more natural place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you the forgetful type who\n",
        "forgets where Berries are planted?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes, yes, I thought so!\n",
        "I’m the same way!\r",
        "I feel a sort of kinship with you!\n",
        "You can have this Pokétch app!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, is that so.\r",
        "Then you’re OK even if I don’t give\n",
        "you this nice thing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "The {STRVAR_1 24, 0, 0} shows you\n",
        "where there are ripe Berries\\fthat are ready to be picked."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Certain kinds of Berries need lots\n",
        "and lots of water."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Um... Would you like some Mulch?\r",
        "If you’re going to grow Berries,\n",
        "Mulch is a good fertilizer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}...\r",
        "I made it by mixing high-grade soil\n",
        "with Pokémon...um...you know...\r",
        "It will promote healthy Berry growth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Um...\n",
        "Please come again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00010",
      "en_US": "You bought some {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m so sorry...\n",
        "Your Bag appears to be full..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0975_SR208R0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Um... You don’t appear to have\n",
        "enough money..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}